.p-4.border-bottom
  h2.card-title-custom AI review

  p.mb-0.mt-1.text-secondary.small
    | Issues detected by AI for this review.

.p-4
  - if @review.review_content.present?
    .ai-review-content
      = markdown(@review.review_content)

  - elsif @review.status == 'failed'
    .alert.alert-danger.mb-0
      i.bi.bi-exclamation-triangle.me-2
      = @review.error_message.presence || 'AI review failed.'

  - else
    .text-center.text-secondary.py-4
      i.bi.bi-hourglass-split.fs-3.d-block.mb-2
      | AI review is processing.
